(Campus IT Usage Policy) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1. Network Access) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Students may register up to 3 devices on the campus WiFi network.) Tj T*
(Each device must be registered with a valid student ID number.) Tj T*
(Unregistered devices will be blocked automatically after 15 minutes.) Tj T*
(Guest accounts are valid for 24 hours and must be sponsored by a current staff member.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2. Remote Access) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(A VPN connection is required to access library databases and internal file servers) Tj T*
(from off campus.) Tj T*
(The VPN client is available from the IT Services website.) Tj T*
(Do not share VPN credentials with anyone, on or off campus.) Tj T*
(VPN sessions are logged and inactive sessions are terminated after 8 hours.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3. Passwords) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Passwords must be at least 12 characters and must be changed every 180 days.) Tj T*
(Reusing any of the previous 5 passwords is not permitted.) Tj T*
(Multi-factor authentication is required for administrative systems.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(4. Acceptable Use) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Campus network resources are provided for teaching, learning and research.) Tj T*
(Peer-to-peer file sharing is prohibited on the campus network.) Tj T*
(Running cryptocurrency mining software is strictly forbidden and will result in) Tj T*
(immediate disconnection.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(5. Data and Storage) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Each student is allocated 50 GB of cloud storage.) Tj T*
(Data stored on university systems may be subject to disclosure under public) Tj T*
(records requests.) Tj T*
(Students should not store sensitive personal data on shared drives.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(6. Support) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The IT Helpdesk is located on level 2 of the student centre.) Tj T*
(It is open from 09:00 to 17:00 on weekdays and is closed on public holidays.) Tj T*
(Urgent security incidents should be reported to security at any time.) Tj T*
ET
